#Mission Info

$Version: 0.10
$Name:  XSTR("Showroom", -1)
$Author: openspace
$Created: 08/02/26 at 00:00:00
$Modified: 08/02/26 at 00:00:00
$Notes:
A static hangar line of the retail roster, for looking at the converted
model set in the Godot presenter. 57 ships in rows by size class, all
inert (ai-play-dead) and all friendly, turned to face the player, who
starts at the origin looking down the line. Nothing here fights, arrives
or departs -- it is a viewing stand, not a gate.

Rows, in +Z order: Terran fighters, Vasudan fighters, Shivan fighters, bombers, support, freight and transport, cruisers and corvettes, capitals.
$End Notes:

$Mission Desc:
 XSTR("The retail roster, standing still", -1)
$end_multi_text

